      "text": "(b) Long vowel stem: δῆλ-\nWhen the last syllable of the stem is long (i.e. contains a 'diphthong' [vowel + ɩ or ʋ] as in δειν-ός, or a long vowel as in δῆλ-ος), -ότερος, -ότατος are added, e.g. δηλότερος, δηλότατος.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "black square",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
