      ],
      "margin_number": 157,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As well as '-er' and 'more -', comparatives can mean 'rather -', 'fairly -',\n'quite -'; superlatives, on top of '-est' and 'most -', also mean 'extremely -', 'very -'.",
